==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[nerve]] [[impulse]]}}

# {{lb|en|physiology}} The signal transmitted along a nerve fibre, either in response to a stimulus (such as touch, pain or heat), or as an instruction (such as causing a muscle to contract).

